WEBVTT

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.360
I'm leaving.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.650
I'm leaving Ahnenerbe!

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.320
I-I don't understand your sudden decision.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.570
What's wrong?

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.580
I've lost my confidence to continue here...

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.120
Because...

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.080
Because we all have the same faces!

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.420
Don't point your finger at me!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.670
No matter where you run...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.420
you cannot escape your destiny.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.430
I'm leaving! I'm leaving for sure!

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.930
I'm leaving!

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.350
So how are we gonna take care of this?

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:42.180
It's starting.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.000
Hey, Shiki!

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.460
Yahoo!

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.340
Arcueid! Damn it...

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.510
How many times have I told you not to come to school?!

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:39.050
But Shiki, you won't even play with me these days.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:40.050
Come on.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.510
Nothing wrong with taking just today off, right?

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.720
I want to go see a movie again!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:45.560
No!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.310
So I just need to avoid getting caught, right?

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:54.480
I already said no!

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:55.690
Hey, that True Ancestor over there.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:59.650
Don't make things hard for Tohno-kun.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:00.610
Senpai.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.740
Good morning, Tohno-kun.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:07.040
You'll be late if you keep entertaining that <i>failure of a vampire</i>.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.000
What?!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.290
I won't be told that by someone who uses dirty tricks and pretends to be a student!

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:16.670
Please don't group me with you, coming all the way to school for your own selfish reasons.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.220
The warning bell.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.470
It's our territory from here on!

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.850
Feel free to go back to your roost or where you came from!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.100
You...!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.470
Arcueid.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:31.560
She saved my life, so I can't be cold to her.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.020
Don't fight with her so much.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.270
Wha-!

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.190
Wh-Wh-Wh...

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:42.200
Boring.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:46.450
Boring. Boring. Boring!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.790
I want to be with Shiki.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.120
I even beat down my drowsiness to come here, too...

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.210
Human rules are so troublesome.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.300
I know! I've got a great idea!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:01.970
I wonder what's wrong.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.890
I haven't seen Arcueid around recently.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:10.180
It's pretty lonely, or should I say disheartening, without her around...

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.400
This is short notice, but let me introduce the transfer student.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.820
I'm Arcueid Brunestud.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.110
Nice to meet you!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.110
What's wrong, Tohno?

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.160
It's been a while, Shiki.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.950
Why is the clichéd scene of a pretty girl transferring in being used here?!

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.660
Eh? Clichéd? But why?

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.670
Come with me for a moment, damn it!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.960
What's the meaning of this?!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.380
Did you cast a spell on everyone?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.840
Or did you use your Mystic Eyes?

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.590
Actually, don't involve everyone in your bit of fun!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.050
Are you sleeping?!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.090
I fell asleep?!

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:45.890
Nevermind that.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.890
No, I didn't cast a spell or anything.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.810
I went through the proper procedure
so you wouldn't get mad at me.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.140
So basically...

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:56.560
You took the entrance exam and got in like a normal person?

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.520
Exactly that.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.270
Everything I did followed human rules.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.730
I won't accept this!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.280
If you commute here...

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:09.700
you'll completely ruin my dignity as the sole heroine of this school.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.580
Oh, it's Ciel! India!

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:12.290
India.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.700
Stop thinking up strange ways to say hello!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.620
To begin with, we can't have vampires coming to school-

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.420
Oh, it's the bell.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.710
We'll be late for class, Shiki.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.210
It's our territory from here on.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:25.220
Why don't you go back to your class or where you came from?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.890
G-Gram Masara!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.310
You're late, transfer student.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.350
Your punishment will be to put everything away.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:39.770
Human rules really are troublesome.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.530
They split the guys and girls during gym class.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.190
The lecture content follows the textbooks to the dot, too.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.530
At this rate...

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.160
At this rate, I'll...

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.540
You got through your first day at school.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.300
So how did you find school, Arcueid?

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:07.630
Hey.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:12.050
That's going to be recorded in a certain famous book, you know.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:20.310
I knew this would happen soon enough.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.980
It's what you'd call a self-evident truth.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.740
It's ridiculous for a vampire to blend into human society to begin with...

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:28.110
What are you guys talking about?

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.780
Being a student is too troublesome, so I became a janitor!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.250
Hey, Shiki! Does this suit me?

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.540
What's the matter, you two?

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.920
You're gonna keep this up?

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.130
Man, school comedies really are great.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.470
I'm reminded of the guys I admired back in the day.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:52.300
There was Hitoshi and Akira and Suguru and Makoto and...

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.180
Shirou gets popular with the girls next!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:01.020
It's about time to take the futons in...

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.780
Ilya!

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.530
And Fuji-nee, too...

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.330
Come on, Ilya!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:16.990
Shirou.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.790
You guys'll crumple the futons I spread out to air.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.880
It feels really good here.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.790
They're warm and smell nice...

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.090
That's exactly why I spread them out to a-

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.930
Shirou, sleep with us, too.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.430
L-Like I said, they'll get crumpled!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.680
Ilya!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.020
Shirou, you're a good boy...

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.890
It does feel pretty good.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:45.110
I wonder if it's because I've been pretty tired recently...

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.490
Wh-What's this?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.330
Should I wake them up?

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.750
But I get the feeling I shouldn't disturb them...

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.550
Quietly...

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:08.920
And what might you be doing?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.380
Nope, stay quiet.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:15.140
Sheesh, those three can really sleep.

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:19.310
It's true that futons aired in the sun feel good, though.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.480
I got the first-class spot!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:25.560
Hey!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:26.980
Rin, you thief!

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.940
That's my spot!

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.240
It smells so good~

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.610
Get up!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.240
Fine!

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.410
You'll wake Shirou up if you make so much noise!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.290
Huh?

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:41.500
He didn't wake up.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.120
He won't.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.210
I made sure he wouldn't.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.670
You cast some spell on Shirou?!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.800
I just wanted to nap with Shirou!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.920
Damn it! Remove it at once!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:55.050
I know! Sheesh!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.300
But... are you sure you want me to remove it?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:00.060
What do you mean?

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.680
Well, okay! You told me to remove it!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.190
Hey!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.610
What are you doing, brat?!

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.820
Situations like this call for a kiss from the princess, obviously!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.190
You've got it the other way round!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:12.900
What?!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.320
So you don't care if Shirou never wakes up?!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.950
Obviously not!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.240
What?!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:21.830
It appears that Taiga isn't waking up either.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:24.210
Did you cast a spell on her, too?

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.290
I did not.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.790
So warm...

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.930
Next section coming up.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.140
Okay, okay, okay!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.100
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.780
Okay! So like, does everyone remember who we are?

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.490
We're the Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.200
Hey, you! What happened to your clothes?!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.240
Oh, they're still in the washing machine.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:01.700
I spilled soy sauce on them.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.700
No! You've got to dress yourself up!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:07.040
This is the time when we've got to really put ourselves out there!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.540
That way, people will remember us for sure...

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:10.960
Listen to me!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.630
Don't worry. That was within my calculations.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.840
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance!

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.090
Anyway, you know?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.680
It's not just the youngsters that have bad manners.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:25.350
In fact, it's the <i>adults</i> who have bad manners these days!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:25.890
Hey.

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:26.310
Yes?

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.640
The stuff I ordered from Amazon will be here soon.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.350
And?

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.400
Can I go home?

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.940
You have no manners at all!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.690
That was also within my calculations.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.190
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.530
Anyway, well... it's almost winter!

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.620
It's going to get really cold...

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.740
Yeah, buy the azuki beans. Sell the salt.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:45.740
Hang up!

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.000
That transaction was within my calculations.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.670
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.750
Man, we totally rocked this one, too!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.800
All of it was within my calculations.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.760
We're definitely winning this year's M1 prize!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.260
I'm telling you, you've got your calculations wrong!

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.440
You're going down!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.520
Magic Circuit Fullcount!

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.400
It doesn't look spicy but it's super spicy!

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.240
Marble Phantasm!

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:24.910
It's so spicy! Ow!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:35.540
The demon Akiha, who lives on destruction and desire,

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:38.590
uses that warped personality of hers to draw a manga.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.340
Who would've thought that she'd be the runner-up?!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.800
You say she's going to devote herself as a manga artist?

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.260
There's no way she'll make it!

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:49.520
And the unexpected ally who appeared then...

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.640
...wasn't of any help.

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.980
Ren, what's that Kombu seaweed for?!

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:57.980
Next, on White Princess Phantasmoon:

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.740
Classroom Chaos!

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:04.490
I'll Marble Phantasm your heart next time, too!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.460
This is the real thing.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.840
Next episode preview!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.590
Why, oh why? Wh-Wh-Wh-Why?

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:46.550
Yo, yo!

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.720
Instructor, what are you trying to do?

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.220
Shirou's theme!

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:51.930
Huh?

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.060
The sexy and assertive Fujimura Taiga

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.230
will really, really really really, sell!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.100
U-Uh...

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.100
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh...

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.940
Why, oh why?

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.190
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why?

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.610
N-N-N-Next, next, next episode:

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.440
Badump. Date Super Plan.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.700
L-L-L-Look f-f-f-forward t-to it.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.910
Check it out.
